.14px; margin-top: 10px;\">\n                    Need help? Contact us at <a href=\"mailto:<EMAIL>\" style=\"text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: 500;color:#427EE4; \"><EMAIL></a>\n                </p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n  </center>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n",
